# Kanyini Home-Grown Skills Marketplace — .gitignore
# Per PLAN-v3.1 §3.6 (Universal DELETE patterns) + §4.6.2 (drift detection).

# Node — repo root has package.json for dev tooling (ajv, semver), node_modules gitignored.
node_modules/
# Forbidden anywhere INSIDE plugins/ (per §3.6 + §5.5.3)
**/node_modules/

# Python build artifacts
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.pyc
**/.cache/

# OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Build artifacts
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/

# Secrets — NEVER commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets/

# Logs
**/*.log

# Drift detection state
.last-ship-manifest.json

# Sanitize working artifacts (regenerable, not source-of-truth)
LEAK-AUDIT.md
sanitize-report.md
sanitize-report-*.md

# IDE noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Coverage
**/coverage/
